  "title": "How a Potluck Became a Celebration of Connection and Culture",
  "summary": "By Marilou Gorospe, Technician Test 3 One of the things I value most about our workplace is the opportunity to learn from people whose experiences, backgrounds, and traditions may be very different from my own. That belief inspired our Multicultural ERG Summer Potluck. We organized the event to showcase the cultural diversity represented across our workforce while creating opportunities […]",
